<title>BELGIUM: Evander to list IDRs in Brussels April 21.</title>
<headline>Evander to list IDRs in Brussels April 21.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Evander Gold Mines Ltd plans to list international depositary receipts on the Brussels Stock Exchange from April 21, issue arangers Dewaay, Servais &amp; Co and Banque Bruxelles Lambert said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Each IDR will represent 50 underlying shares. A prospectus covering the issue is being finalised and should be published on April 18, a spokesman for BBL said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
